ely<a name=\"athis-answers-whoqol-int-extremely\"> </a></td><td>Äußerst</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">whoqol-cap-not-at-all<a name=\"athis-answers-whoqol-cap-not-at-all\"> </a></td><td>Überhaupt nicht</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">whoqol-cap-not-really<a name=\"athis-answers-whoqol-cap-not-really\"> </a></td><td>Eher nicht</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">whoqol-cap-moderately<a name=\"athis-answers-whoqol-cap-moderately\"> </a></td><td>Halbwegs</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">whoqol-cap-mostly<a name=\"athis-answers-whoqol-cap-mostly\"> </a></td><td>Überwiegend</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">whoqol-cap-completely<a name=\"athis-answers-whoqol-cap-completely\"> </a></td><td>Völlig</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">whoqol-neg-never<a name=\"athis-answers-whoqol-neg-never\"> </a></td><td>Niemals</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">whoqol-neg-not-often<a name=\"athis-answers-whoqol-neg-not-often\"> </a></td><td>Nicht oft</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">whoqol-neg-sometimes<a name=\"athis-answers-whoqol-neg-sometimes\"> </a></td><td>Zeitweilig</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">whoqol-neg-often<a name=\"athis-answers-whoqol-neg-often\"> </a></td><td>Oftmals</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">whoqol-neg-always<a name=\"athis-answers-whoqol-neg-always\"> </a></td><td>Immer</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">kig-never<a name=\"athis-answers-kig-never\"> </a></td><td>Nie</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">kig-seldom<a name=\"athis-answers-kig-seldom\"> </a></td><td>Selten</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">kig-sometimes<a name=\"athis-answers-kig-sometimes\"> </a></td><td>Manchmal</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">kig-often<a name=\"athis-answers-kig-often\"> </a></td><td>Oft</td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">kig-always<a name=\"athis-answers-kig-always\"> </a></td><td>Immer</td></tr><tr>